---
title: Chokecherry Syrup
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Good Morning, Morning Glory!
cook time: 15 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@wild chokecherries{2%cups} (any wild berry will do)
@white Karo syrup{0.5%cup}
@sugar{3%cups}

Bring ingredients to a boil in a large saucepan. Turn heat down and simmer for 15 minutes. Skim off scum. Cool. Bottle in jars and refrigerate.
